libmbim (1.32.0-0marble1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Build libmbim 1.32.0 from upstream for the Ubuntu 24.04 build baseline.
    Noble ships 1.31.2, which is below the libmbim-glib >= 1.32 required by
    modemmanager-marble; Debian trixie/forky/sid already provide a new enough
    archive package and skip this local copy at rootfs install time.
  * Disable introspection, man pages and bash completion: this package exists
    to provide the runtime library and the headers/pkg-config file consumed by
    ModemManager, not to replace the distribution's full libmbim packaging.

